I like it.

322
00:13:23,903 --> 00:13:25,413
My goodness.

323
00:13:25,773 --> 00:13:27,543
It's not easy to appear on our show twice.

324
00:13:29,343 --> 00:13:31,143
I guess we were too nice to him last time.

325
00:13:31,583 --> 00:13:33,253
I think we were too nice to him last time.

326
00:13:33,313 --> 00:13:35,683
Did I get to do anything I wanted to do today?

327
00:13:35,923 --> 00:13:40,223
