389
00:16:06,733 --> 00:16:08,943
- Have you been doing well?
- Yes.

390
00:16:10,003 --> 00:16:11,402
He's my manager today.

391
00:16:11,403 --> 00:16:12,512
- Is that so?
- I'm his secretary.

392
00:16:12,513 --> 00:16:13,543
Who's the manager?

393
00:16:14,013 --> 00:16:15,783
I'm the manager.

394
00:16:15,813 --> 00:16:17,782
He's my secretary who's working for me.

395
00:16:17,783 --> 00:16:19,052
