396
00:16:19,053 --> 00:16:20,753
- Is he your secretary?
- Yes, he's my secretary.

397
00:16:21,113 --> 00:16:25,323
(He's still working as a subcontractor for a subcontractor.)

398
00:16:25,893 --> 00:16:27,852
- By the way, - Yes.

399
00:16:27,853 --> 00:16:29,422
- could you...
- Yes.

400
00:16:29,423 --> 00:16:31,292
- take some photos of me...
- Okay.

401
00:16:31,293 --> 00:16:33,092
- with this film camera...
- Don't you think it's a waste?

402
00:16:33,093 --> 00:16:34,132
from time to time?

403
00:16:34,133 --> 00:16:35,562
Sure, I will.

404
00:16:35,563 --> 00:16:37,063
- Let me take a photo.
- Okay.

405
00:16:37,403 --> 00:16:38,672
Yes.

406
00:16:38,673 --> 00:16:41,773
Just take the photos as naturally as possible.

407
00:16:42,273 --> 00:16:45,173
