Okay.

414
00:16:57,053 --> 00:16:58,122
Three.

415
00:16:58,123 --> 00:16:59,593
(Unnatural)

416
00:16:59,693 --> 00:17:02,362
- Just take them naturally.
- Why don't you stand together?

417
00:17:02,363 --> 00:17:03,822
Why don't you stand together?

418
