That's not what he asked.

419
00:17:05,493 --> 00:17:07,233
He didn't tell you to take a photo of his manager.

420
00:17:07,663 --> 00:17:08,833
Take photos with him.

421
00:17:09,463 --> 00:17:10,662
- Stand together.
- Why are you acting like this?

422
00:17:10,663 --> 00:17:12,102
