423
00:17:12,103 --> 00:17:13,973
No. Don't take photos like this.

424
00:17:14,533 --> 00:17:17,572
If you take some good photos, I'll get them developed,

425
00:17:17,573 --> 00:17:19,042
post them on Instagram,

426
00:17:19,043 --> 00:17:21,513
- and use them as content.
- Please listen to him.

427
00:17:21,743 --> 00:17:23,042
(Sorry)

428
00:17:23,043 --> 00:17:26,512
I guess I'll struggle today just like I did last time.

429
00:17:26,513 --> 00:17:27,583
- Yes.
- Yes.

430
00:17:29,753 --> 00:17:32,553
