435
00:17:46,603 --> 00:17:48,432
In 1, 2, 3.

436
00:17:48,433 --> 00:17:51,202
(It looks like he's taking a photo at a wedding hall.)

437
00:17:51,203 --> 00:17:52,343
Is it taken?

438
00:17:52,413 --> 00:17:54,912
