439
00:17:54,913 --> 00:17:56,812
- Yes.
- We do anything they want.

440
00:17:56,813 --> 00:17:58,112
Really?

441
00:17:58,113 --> 00:17:59,982
Are you going to pick up the developed photos later?

442
00:17:59,983 --> 00:18:01,813
I guess they will.

443
00:18:02,653 --> 00:18:04,083
Chang Wook will get them developed.

444
00:18:04,523 --> 00:18:06,092
