445
00:18:06,093 --> 00:18:09,793
("I Came to a Press Conference." Photo by Kwang Kyu)

446
00:18:10,423 --> 00:18:12,333
Did you actually ride the horse?

447
00:18:12,463 --> 00:18:14,232
- Yes.
- You did an amazing job.

448
00:18:14,233 --> 00:18:16,562
We filmed all the horseback-riding scenes...

449
00:18:16,563 --> 00:18:19,873
- in one day. It was exhausting.
- Really?

450
00:18:20,503 --> 00:18:22,373
It surprised me. You have amazing horseback-riding skills.

451
00:18:22,843 --> 00:18:24,572
I spent the whole day riding horses.

452
00:18:24,573 --> 00:18:26,812
Is there anything else that surprised you?

453
00:18:26,813 --> 00:18:28,013
Anything else?

454
00:18:28,113 --> 00:18:30,283
(Laughing)

455
00:18:30,543 --> 00:18:31,882
It was full of surprises.

456
00:18:31,883 --> 00:18:34,483
