- How?

461
00:18:40,353 --> 00:18:42,223
You look a lot younger.

462
00:18:42,523 --> 00:18:45,023
You look much younger than before.

463
00:18:45,463 --> 00:18:47,162
- We haven't met for a long time.
- Right.

464
00:18:47,163 --> 00:18:49,202
