468
00:18:53,874 --> 00:18:55,872
- "Modern Boy."
- Of course.

469
00:18:55,873 --> 00:18:57,702
How have you been?

470
00:18:57,703 --> 00:19:00,672
I've been doing variety shows.

471
00:19:00,673 --> 00:19:01,973
I see.

472
00:19:04,183 --> 00:19:06,312
When I was a rookie actor,

473
00:19:06,313 --> 00:19:08,052
