474
00:19:08,053 --> 00:19:09,182
Which one?

475
00:19:09,183 --> 00:19:10,382
(Chang Wook joins them.)

476
00:19:10,383 --> 00:19:11,523
What was it?

477
00:19:12,223 --> 00:19:13,322
What was it?

478
00:19:13,323 --> 00:19:15,093
(My Star joins them, but they barely pay him any attention.)

479
00:19:16,163 --> 00:19:17,862
- "Happy End."
- "Happy End."

480
00:19:17,863 --> 00:19:19,332
So did you audition...

481
00:19:19,333 --> 00:19:20,763
- for the role Joo Jin Mo played?
- Yes.

482
00:19:21,433 --> 00:19:22,533
And I got rejected.

483
00:19:22,703 --> 00:19:23,903
This is awkward.

484
00:19:26,473 --> 00:19:28,632
(They're still talking with the director.)

485
00:19:28,633 --> 00:19:31,172
The press conference.

486
00:19:31,173 --> 00:19:32,742
(Oh, right!)

487
00:19:32,743 --> 00:19:35,073
(He finally saw My Star.)

488
00:19:35,143 --> 00:19:38,182
Please keep a close eye on it.

489
00:19:38,183 --> 00:19:41,183
- Sure.
- I'm quite sensitive today.

490
00:19:42,083 --> 00:19:45,852
Please keep a close eye on me.

491
00:19:45,853 --> 00:19:46,853
Okay, I will.

492
00:19:47,223 --> 00:19:50,193
(Please pay attention to me as well.)

493
00:19:50,723 --> 00:19:52,962
