496
00:20:00,533 --> 00:20:03,202
I'm Kyung Rim from the Park family,

497
00:20:03,203 --> 00:20:05,073
and I'll be hosting today's press conference for "The Scandal."

498
00:20:05,303 --> 00:20:07,043
