1594
01:01:48,273 --> 01:01:50,413
I love it. It gives me time to think.

1595
01:01:50,573 --> 01:01:52,383
(Scratching)

1596
01:01:52,543 --> 01:01:54,753
It's fun to run together too.

1597
01:01:55,353 --> 01:01:57,152
