1615
01:02:34,793 --> 01:02:37,192
I just said...

1616
01:02:37,193 --> 01:02:38,362
I like going hiking alone.

1617
01:02:38,363 --> 01:02:39,962
You two should live together.

1618
01:02:39,963 --> 01:02:41,563
